# Agent trust gate

- Extend OpenAPI endpoints, npm packages, and MCP tools through
  `skills/agent-trust/references/paved-path.md`.
- Keep `skills/agent-trust/feature-map.json` synchronized with MCP tool
  registrations, SDK package exports, and non-generated SDK/MCP docs routes.
- Run `npm run agent-verify` before handing off code changes. Do not claim a
  passing result from `agent-verify:quick`.
- Keep generated files generated and credentials out of this public repository.
